<title>USA: First USA Inc Q2 Dec 31 net.</title>
<headline>First USA Inc Q2 Dec 31 net.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.58		    $0.44</p>
<p> Net			 79,132		   58,929</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 136,961		  133,295</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.05		    $0.86</p>
<p> Net			143,188		  113,824</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 136,057		  133,031</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Current year net both periods includes pretax gain $106.9 million from sale of 4.4 million shares of First USA Paymentech Inc affiliate.  Company said gain was offset by expenses related to product development and marketing and by additional provision of $44 million to allowance for possible credit losses, bringing allowance at end of Q2 to $122.6 million vs $70.0 million.</p>
<p>Current half net includes charge $7.4 million aftertax or $0.06 shr related to acquisition by First USA Paymentech, now 57 pct owned.</p>
</text>
